  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthy Habits: Education and Training Program in Good Health Habits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proyecto de Salud Sangre de Cristo (PSSC) will work with groups of organized outreach workers in three public schools located in the outskirts of Guatemala City to launch a program that encourages healthy eating and personal hygiene. Grant activities will benefit approximately 1,000 Guatemalan children directly and their family members indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
